# Intentionally empty of patterns.
#
# Without this file Semgrep applies a built-in ignore list that skips test/ and tests/ directories.
# This repository's scanners are meant to see all committed code, so this file replaces that default
# and ignores nothing. Uncommitted paths (node_modules, .venv, ...) are not scanned anyway because
# Semgrep only scans files tracked by git.
